            "text": "ingress-nginx插件的排查步骤包括：检查helm安装状态、查看pods运行状态、检查service配置。具体命令为：`helm -n ingress-nginx ls`、`kubectl -n ingress-nginx get pods`、`kubectl -n ingress-nginx get svc`。",
