          },
          {
            "text": "ingress-nginx插件可通过`sealos run registry.cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/cnmirror/ingress-nginx-cucc:v1.6.4`命令安装，卸载命令为`helm -n ingress-nginx uninstall ingress-nginx`。",
